    },
    "question": {
      ":question/id": "833031f4-fe55-5835-b1aa-980412417365",
      ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/moderate",
      ":question/problem": "Consider the following system of equations.\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}2x-4y &=-2 \\\\ -6x-8y &=-5 \\\\ 4x-8y &=-9\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\nSelect all that apply.\n\n- **I.** The system is consistent dependent\n- **II.** The system has a unique solution\n- **III.** The system is inconsistent",
      ":question/worked-solution": "To classify the system, we first need to find its solution. The augmented matrix for this system is\n\n$$\nM=\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}2 & -4 & -2 \\\\ -6 & -8 & -5 \\\\ 4 & -8 & -9\\end{array}\\right].\n$$\n\nUsing the method of Gaussian elimination, we can reduce this matrix to row echelon form as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & =\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}2 & -4 & -2 \\\\ -6 & -8 & -5 \\\\ 4 & -8 & -9\\end{array}\\right] & {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}+3{R}_{1} \\\\  & \u223c\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}2 & -4 & -2 \\\\ 0 & -20 & -11 \\\\ 4 & -8 & -9\\end{array}\\right] & {R}_{3} & :={R}_{3}-2{R}_{1} \\\\  & \u223c\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}2 & -4 & -2 \\\\ 0 & -20 & -11 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -5\\end{array}\\right]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe final row corresponds to the equation $0x+0y=-5,$ and this has no solution. Therefore, our system has no solution, and we conclude that the system is inconsistent.\n\nAs a result, only statement III is true.",
      ":question/answer-fields": [
        {
          ":answer-field/id": "3fb29e1a-190e-5424-9f22-48ea7f8db52e",
          ":answer-field/key": "I",
