  {
    "knowledge_point": {
      "db_id": 17592186115299,
      "id": "f9469d5c-e097-590c-8ddb-2c7fda353fac",
      "title": "Classifying a System as Consistent Dependent, Consistent Independent, or Inconsistent"
    },
    "question": {
      ":question/id": "6c48681e-a703-5f1a-90eb-3013fb279f45",
      ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/moderate",
      ":question/problem": "Consider the following system of equations\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}-2x-8y &=9 \\\\ -4x-14y &=18 \\\\ 8x+30y &=-36.\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\nI. The system is consistent independent\n\nII. The system has no solution\n\nIII. The system is consistent dependent",
      ":question/worked-solution": "To classify the system, we first need to find its solution. The augmented matrix for this system is \n\n$$\nM=\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}-2 & -8 & 9 \\\\ -4 & -14 & 18 \\\\ 8 & 30 & -36\\end{array}\\right].\n$$\n\nUsing the method of Gaussian elimination, we can reduce this matrix to row echelon form as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & =\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}-2 & -8 & 9 \\\\ -4 & -14 & 18 \\\\ 8 & 30 & -36\\end{array}\\right] & {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}+(-2){R}_{1} \\\\  & \u223c\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}-2 & -8 & 9 \\\\ 0 & 2 & 0 \\\\ 8 & 30 & -36\\end{array}\\right] & {R}_{3} & :={R}_{3}+4{R}_{1} \\\\  & \u223c\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}-2 & -8 & 9 \\\\ 0 & 2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -2 & 0\\end{array}\\right] & {R}_{3} & :={R}_{3}+{R}_{2} \\\\  & \u223c\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}-2 & -8 & 9 \\\\ 0 & 2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0\\end{array}\\right]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \n\nSince any numbers $x$ and $y$ are solutions to the third equation $0x+0y=0$, we can remove this equation from the system. So, the corresponding system is now\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}-2x-8y &=9 \\\\ 2y &=0.\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nFrom the second equation we have $y=0$ and substituting this into the first equation yields $x=-\\frac{9}{2}.$ So,  we conclude that the system is consistent independent. \n\nAs a result, only statement I is true.",
      ":question/answer-fields": [
        {
          ":answer-field/id": "96009fcb-7d03-51c6-8bd3-d4159c82610c",
          ":answer-field/key": "selection",
          ":answer-field/type": ":answer-field.type/radio",
          ":answer-field/choices": [
            {
              ":answer/id": "93897e5b-4621-5f25-b0ac-76426cd2fd68",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text",
              ":answer/value": "II only"
            },
            {
              ":answer/id": "1a51456f-4698-5c8d-9ef1-adf229bc27ce",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text",
              ":answer/value": "I and II only"
            },
            {
              ":answer/id": "92675606-5c42-52aa-bce4-87e5a2e164c6",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text",
              ":answer/value": "II and III only"
            },
            {
              ":answer/id": "94083884-6387-5514-964b-3e17ce8f967d",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text",
              ":answer/value": "I only"
            },
            {
              ":answer/id": "550c8222-06e8-5309-bac6-da24a35e16a7",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text",
              ":answer/value": "III only"
            }
